# XcodeGen: project.yml is authoritative, but GZ-BT.xcodeproj IS committed (regenerated
# and re-committed at each checkpoint) so a fresh clone builds with zero external tooling.
# Only user-specific state inside the project is ignored (see xcuserdata / xcuserstate above).

# Swift Package Manager
.build/
.swiftpm/

